{"unit_id":"tag:0H7B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（sites）的态射（morphism），对应于连续的（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 上阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的系（system）。置 <MATH_0005>。设 <MATH_0006> 为整数（integer）。以 <MATH_0007> 表示满足\n<MATH_0009>\n的 <MATH_0008> 所组成的集合（set）。若 <MATH_0010> 的每个对象（object）都有由 <MATH_0011> 的元素（elements）构成的覆盖（covering），则 <MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"态射两端位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"位点态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"位点函子连续性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"位点态射对应函子"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系","context":"阿贝尔层系"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数","context":"上同调次数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"满足消失条件的对象集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"选定对象集合的元素"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"对象的覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0H7B:proof","translation":"回顾，<MATH_0001> 是预层（presheaf）<MATH_0002> 的层化（sheafification），该预层将 <MATH_0003> 送到 <MATH_0004>，见引理 <REF_0001>。类似地，<MATH_0005> 是预层（presheaf）<MATH_0006> 的层化（sheafification），该预层将 <MATH_0007> 送到 <MATH_0008>。回顾，层化（sheafification）是从层（sheaves）到预层（presheaves）的包含（inclusion）的左伴随（left adjoint），见《位点（Sites）》第 <REF_0002> 节。因此层化（sheafification）与余极限（colimits）可交换（commutes），见《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0003>。所以只需证明预层（presheaves）的映射（map）（余极限（colimit）取于预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）中）\n<MATH_0009>\n在层化（sheafifications）上诱导同构（isomorphism）。这由《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0004> 和我们对 <MATH_0010> 的假设推出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheafifications","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"上同调预层"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"上同调预层的层化"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"预层范畴"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"层到预层的包含函子"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随","context":"层化的伴随性"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"层化与余极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"函子与余极限交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"预层比较映射"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限","context":"预层范畴中的余极限"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheafifications","target_term":"层化","context":"比较映射层化"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"层化后的同构"}],"notes":[]}
